              "recovery.rehearsal_isolation#tb4",
              "recovery.rehearsal_isolation#tb5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "role": "mechanism",
          "text": "Check that restoration destinations and client test traffic do not point to production. Record approved scope and stop conditions before provisioning resources or directing traffic. A sandbox label alone is not evidence of isolation.",
